<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT-Merrill raises Hillenbrand.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT-Merrill raises Hillenbrand.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Merrill Lynch &amp; Co said it upgraded Hillenbrand Industries Inc to a near-term accumulate from a neutral on Wednesday.</p>
<p>-- The stock is still a long-term buy, Merrill Lynch said.</p>
<p>-- Shares in casket-maker Hillenbrand closed at 35-2/4 on Tuesday.</p>
</text>
